CLAUDE.md

# The VPS keeps the postgres credentials in a repo-root .env next to
# docker-compose.prod.yml, and the deploy runs `git pull` in that working
# tree. Without this line the file sits there untracked-but-not-ignored,
# one `git add -A` away from being committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example